# Curated dock favorites for the gnome-base module: each entry is a
# .desktop id that is appended to the user's dock when missing (merge,
# never replace). Keep the set small and harmless: entries that do not
# exist on a given install simply stay absent (gsettings stores the id
# only if present); apps the user already pinned are left untouched.
org.gnome.Nautilus.desktop
firefox.desktop